<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Bali Imóveis - Dashboard Gerencial (v1.5 - Fase 3.5E)</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    .clickable { cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .clickable:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .tab-active { border-bottom: 2px solid #3b82f6; color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: bold; }
    .tab-inactive { color: #6b7280; }
    .tab-inactive:hover { color: #374151; }
    .details-row { display: none; background-color: #f8fafc; }
    .details-row.open { display: table-row; }
  </style>
<script src="/xlsx.full.min.js"></script></head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 p-8 font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div id="toast-container" class="fixed top-4 right-4 z-50 flex flex-col gap-2"></div>

    <header class="mb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">Painel Gerencial de Leads</h1>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mt-2 flex-wrap">
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" id="meta-periodo">Carregando período...</p>
          <span class="text-gray-300">•</span>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 shadow-sm" id="badge-base-atualizada" title="Data e hora da gravação real do snapshot no disco">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
            <span id="texto-base-atualizada">Base atualizada em: verificando...</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2">
        <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-sm font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded border border-blue-400">FASE 3.5E - Pauta de Reunião 1:1</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="flex border-b border-gray-300 mb-6">
      <button onclick="switchTab('visao')" id="tab-visao" class="py-2 px-4 tab-active">Visão Geral (Contagem)</button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('gestao')" id="tab-gestao" class="py-2 px-4 tab-inactive text-purple-700 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
        Gestão da Carteira (1:1)
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de Filtros (Global) -->
    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <label class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">Período</label>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <input type="date" id="filter-inicio" class="text-sm border rounded p-2">
          <span class="text-gray-400">até</span>
          <input type="date" id="filter-fim" class="text-sm border rounded p-2">
        </div>
      </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <label class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">Funil</label>
          <select id="filter-funil" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 w-48" onchange="renderCardsTable()">
            <option value="todos_exceto_3500">Todos exceto Lançamentos</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <label class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">Etapa</label>
        <select id="filter-etapa" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 w-40" onchange="renderCardsTable()"><option value="">Todas</option></select>
      </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
              <label class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-600">Corretor</label>
              <select id="filter-corretor" class="border rounded p-2 text-sm bg-white shadow-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500" onchange="renderCardsTable()"></select>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 justify-end">
        <button onclick="applyFilters()" class="bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-bold">Aplicar</button>
        <button onclick="clearFilters()" class="bg-gray-300 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-bold">Limpar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TELA 1: Visão Geral -->
    <div id="view-visao-geral">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-5 border-l-4 border-blue-600">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-gray-500 text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Leads Únicos (CRM)</h3>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold">Visão Geral</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 mt-2" id="kpi-unicos">-</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 block">Todas as entradas registradas no CRM no período</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-5 border-l-4 border-indigo-500">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-gray-500 text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Carteira Operacional</h3>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 font-bold">30 Etapas Ativas</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-indigo-700 mt-2" id="kpi-unicos-carteira">-</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 block">Clientes comerciais ativos em acompanhamento</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-5 border-l-4 border-purple-500">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-gray-500 text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Total de Cards</h3>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-bold">Participações</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-purple-700 mt-2" id="kpi-cards">-</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 block">Cards ativos monitorados na carteira</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Detalhamento de Entradas por Pipeline (5 Categorias Conceituais) -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            📊 Distribuição de Entradas por Pipeline (CRM)
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-200">
            Regra: Visão Geral contempla 100% dos cadastros do período selecionado
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3.5" id="pipeline-distribution-container">
          <!-- Injetado dinamicamente -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        📁 Carteira Comercial Ativa por Funil (1:1)
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6" id="funnels-container"></div>

      <!-- A Visão por Funil e Corretores unificada será injetada no funnels-container -->
    </div>

    <!-- TELA 3: Gestão da Carteira (Reuniões 1:1) -->
    <div id="view-gestao" class="hidden">
      
      <!-- Filtros Locais da Aba de Gestão -->
        <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6 shadow-sm flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
           <div class="flex flex-col flex-grow min-w-[200px]">
             <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">Buscar (Nome ou ID)</label>
             <input type="text" id="filter-search" placeholder="Ex: Maria ou 12345" class="text-sm border rounded p-2" onkeyup="renderCardsTable()">
           </div>
           <div class="flex flex-col">
             <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">Situação dos Comentários</label>
             <select id="filter-comentarios" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 bg-white" onchange="renderCardsTable()">
               <option value="todos">Todos</option>
               <option value="com_comentarios">Com comentários no histórico</option>
               <option value="sem_comentarios">Sem comentários no histórico</option>
               <option value="nao_verificado">Não verificado</option>
               <option value="expirado">Consulta expirada</option>
             </select>
           </div>
           <div class="flex flex-col">
             <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">Pauta de Reunião</label>
             <select id="filter-pauta" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 bg-white" onchange="renderCardsTable()">
               <option value="todos">Todos</option>
               <option value="marcados">Próxima reunião (Marcados)</option>
               <option value="retomar">🎯 Casos para retomar (Pendente, Aguardando, Vencido ou Sem acomp.)</option>
               <option value="dispensados">Discutidos (Sem necessidade de retorno)</option>
             </select>
           </div>
           <div class="flex flex-col">
             <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">Situação Acomp.</label>
             <select id="filter-situacao" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 bg-white" onchange="renderCardsTable()">
               <option value="todos">Todos</option>
               <option value="acoes_executar">⚡ Ações a executar (Pendente ou Aguardando)</option>
               <option value="Pendente">Pendente</option>
               <option value="Aguardando retorno">Aguardando retorno</option>
               <option value="Concluído">Concluído</option>
               <option value="Não informado">Não informado</option>
               <option value="sem_acomp">Sem acompanhamento</option>
             </select>
           </div>
           <div class="flex flex-col">
             <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">Prazo</label>
             <select id="filter-prazo" class="text-sm border rounded p-2 bg-white" onchange="renderCardsTable()">
               <option value="todos">Todos</option>
               <option value="vencido">⚠️ Ações vencidas</option>
             </select>
           </div>
           
            <div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap flex-grow items-end justify-end gap-2">
              <button id="btn-open-sync-modal" onclick="openSyncModal()" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow" title="Atualizar carteira de leads no ImobTotal">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
                  Atualizar leads
               </button>
              <button id="btn-open-resumo-modal" onclick="openResumoModal()" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow" title="Gerar texto dos combinados desta data para WhatsApp">
                 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
                 Gerar resumo dos combinados
              </button>
              <button onclick="prepareBulkVerification()" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition">
                 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
                 Verificar comentários em lote
              </button>
              <button id="btn-export-excel" onclick="exportToExcel()" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow">
                 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
                 Exportar Excel
              </button>
              <button id="btn-select-all" onclick="toggleSelectAllFiltered(true)" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow">
                 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                 Selecionar todos os leads
              </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MODAL BULK COMMENTS -->
        <div id="modal-bulk-comments" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
           <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 w-full max-w-md flex flex-col">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Verificar Comentários em Lote</h3>
              
              <div id="bulk-step-1">
                 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Esta operação fará uma varredura nos clientes atualmente filtrados que ainda não tiveram seus históricos verificados.</p>
                 
                 <ul class="text-sm mb-6 bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded border">
                    <li class="flex justify-between mb-1"><span>Total de clientes (únicos):</span> <strong id="bulk-total" class="text-gray-800">0</strong></li>
                    <li class="flex justify-between mb-1"><span>Com cache válido (ignorado):</span> <strong id="bulk-cached" class="text-green-700">0</strong></li>
                    <li class="flex justify-between mt-2 pt-2 border-t"><span>Pendentes de verificação:</span> <strong id="bulk-pending" class="text-blue-700">0</strong></li>
                    <li class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><span>Requisições estimadas (API):</span> <strong id="bulk-reqs">0</strong></li>
                 </ul>
                 
                 <div class="flex justify-end gap-2">
                    <button onclick="document.getElementById('modal-bulk-comments').classList.add('hidden')" class="px-4 py-2 border rounded text-gray-600 font-bold hover:bg-gray-100">Cancelar</button>
                    <button id="btn-start-bulk" onclick="executeBulkVerification()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded font-bold hover:bg-indigo-700">Iniciar Verificação</button>
                 </div>
              </div>
              
              <div id="bulk-step-2" class="hidden flex flex-col">
                 <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2" id="bulk-status-text">Verificando cliente 0 de 0...</p>
                 <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5 mb-4">
                    <div id="bulk-progress-bar" class="bg-indigo-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 0%"></div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4 h-12 overflow-y-auto border p-2 bg-gray-50 rounded" id="bulk-log">
                    <!-- Logs da execução -->
                 </div>
                 
                  <div class="flex justify-end">
                     <button id="btn-stop-bulk" onclick="stopBulkVerification()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 text-white rounded font-bold hover:bg-red-700">Interromper fila</button>
                     <button id="btn-close-bulk" onclick="closeBulkVerification()" class="hidden px-4 py-2 bg-gray-600 text-white rounded font-bold hover:bg-gray-700">Fechar e ver tabela</button>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>

        <!-- MODAL RESUMO DOS COMBINADOS (Fase 3.5N) -->
        <div id="modal-resumo-reuniao" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
           <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 w-full max-w-2xl flex flex-col max-h-[90vh]">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b mb-4">
                 <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                   📝 Resumo dos Combinados da Reunião
                 </h3>
                 <button onclick="fecharResumoModal()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 text-lg font-bold">✕</button>
              </div>

              <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded p-3 mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3">
                 <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-[160px]">
                    <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-1">Corretor:</label>
                    <select id="modal-resumo-corretor" class="text-sm border rounded p-1.5 bg-white shadow-sm" onchange="onResumoParamsChange()"></select>
                 </div>
                 <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-[140px]">
                    <label class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-1">Data da Reunião:</label>
                    <input type="date" id="modal-resumo-data" class="text-sm border rounded p-1.5 bg-white shadow-sm" onchange="onResumoParamsChange()">
                 </div>
                 <button id="btn-carregar-gerar-resumo" onclick="carregarOuGerarResumo()" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-xs px-3.5 py-2 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
                    🔄 Carregar / Gerar
                 </button>
              </div>

              <div id="modal-resumo-status-alert" class="hidden text-xs p-2 rounded mb-3"></div>

              <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-[220px] mb-4">
                 <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                    <label class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700">Texto dos Combinados (Editável antes de copiar/salvar):</label>
                    <span id="modal-resumo-unsaved-badge" class="hidden text-[10px] text-amber-700 bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">● Alterações não salvas</span>
                 </div>
                 <textarea id="modal-resumo-texto" class="w-full flex-1 min-h-[220px] p-3 text-xs font-mono border rounded shadow-inner bg-gray-50 focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 leading-relaxed" placeholder="Selecione o corretor e a data e clique em Carregar / Gerar..." oninput="onResumoTextareaChange()"></textarea>
                 <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1">💡 Dica: O texto usa formatação nativa do WhatsApp (*negrito*, quebras e tópicos). Você pode editá-lo à vontade.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-t">
                 <button id="btn-salvar-resumo" onclick="salvarResumoLocalmente()" class="bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 font-bold text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
                    💾 Salvar Resumo Localmente
                 </button>
                 <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <button onclick="fecharResumoModal()" class="px-3 py-2 border rounded text-xs text-gray-600 font-bold hover:bg-gray-100">
                       Fechar
                    </button>
                    <button id="btn-copiar-resumo" onclick="copiarResumoWhatsApp()" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded shadow flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
                       📋 Copiar Resumo (WhatsApp)
                    </button>
                 </div>
              </div>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MODAL ATUALIZAÇÃO SEGURA DE LEADS (Fase 3.5P) -->
        <div id="modal-sync-leads" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
           <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 w-full max-w-2xl flex flex-col max-h-[90vh]">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 mb-3">
                 <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                   🔄 Atualização da Carteira de Leads
                 </h3>
                 <button onclick="requestCloseSyncModal()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 text-lg font-bold" title="Fechar modal">✕</button>
              </div>

              <!-- STEPPER DE 4 ETAPAS -->
              <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 mb-4 text-[11px] font-bold border-b pb-3 text-center" id="sync-stepper">
                 <div id="step-ind-1" class="py-1.5 px-1 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 border border-blue-300 transition">1. Consultar CRM</div>
                 <div id="step-ind-2" class="py-1.5 px-1 rounded bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 border border-gray-200 transition">2. Conferir alterações</div>
                 <div id="step-ind-3" class="py-1.5 px-1 rounded bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 border border-gray-200 transition">3. Gravar atualização</div>
                 <div id="step-ind-4" class="py-1.5 px-1 rounded bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 border border-gray-200 transition">4. Concluído</div>
              </div>

              <!-- PASSO 1: ORIENTAÇÃO E CONSULTA AO CRM -->
              <div id="sync-step-1" class="flex flex-col">
                 <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold border border-emerald-300">
                      🟢 Consulta Segura ao ImobTotal
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Varredura exclusiva nas 30 etapas ativas dos 4 funis comerciais.</span>
                 </div>

                 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">
                   Esta etapa consulta o CRM em modo de leitura para identificar novos leads, mudanças de etapa e alterações de corretor, permitindo que você confira tudo antes de aplicar qualquer gravação.
                 </p>

                  <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-lg p-3.5 mb-4 text-xs space-y-2 text-indigo-950">
                     <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold min-w-[140px]">🎯 Funis e Etapas:</span>
                        <span><b>30 Etapas Comerciais Ativas</b> (Terceiros: 6, MAP: 7, MCMV: 7, Lançamentos: 10).</span>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold min-w-[140px]">👥 Clientes da Carteira:</span>
                        <span>Todos os clientes existentes na carteira local são <b>reconfirmados e atualizados</b> sem restrição de data de cadastro. Cards em etapas inativas permanecem <b>preservados intactos</b>.</span>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold min-w-[140px]">🆕 Novos Clientes:</span>
                        <span>Novos leads encontrados nas etapas ativas são importados somente se cadastrados nos <b>últimos 60 dias</b>.</span>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
